# Saved predictions are single-line JSON blobs of ~750 KB that take an hour to
# regenerate. Git cannot merge them and neither can a human: mark them binary so a
# concurrent change is a clean "both modified" conflict instead of a corrupted file.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md for who regenerates them.
results/preds/*.json binary
results/*.npy        binary
*.npz                binary

# Build artefacts. Rebuild from docs/tex/ rather than merging.
*.pdf                binary

# The lock file is generated; keep it out of diffs but always commit it.
uv.lock              -diff linguist-generated=true
